            <ArticleTitle>Strategies for effective postoperative pain management.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>145-50</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Postoperative pain management an important clinical issue. The clinicians tool-bag remains incomplete. Improvements in the management of postoperative pain will ultimately translate into the broader, safer application of surgical procedures upon a wider patient population. The application of multimodal therapy that includes non-pharmacologic therapies, preemptive therapies, and new medications for the treatment of postoperative pain is an emerging concept that provides significant immediate as well as potential future advantages.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
